title: Denial Intelligence › Open denials list › Filter by payer and reason
route: /denials?payer=cardinal&reason=Late notice
intro: Three ways to narrow the dashboard table, all kept in the address: the figures (which also switch to Closed), one payer chip, and a reason that arrives from Analytics. They combine. The figures keep counting the whole view, so 'Open 8' stays 8 while a payer is picked.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On the dashboard, or open /denials?payer=cardinal&reason=... from Analytics\n('Open in Denial Intelligence' on a reason, a row of 'Common denial reasons by payer')"
screen fg "Figures 'Open', 'Deadlines this week', 'To decide', 'Peer-to-peer booked', 'Appeals in progress', 'Closed'"
click cf "Click a figure"
process pf "'Deadlines this week': 7 days or less on our own clock, overdue included\n'To decide': nothing under way; 'Peer-to-peer booked': chip 'Call booked'\n'Appeals in progress': drafting or with the payer; 'Closed': settled here"
screen pc "Payer chips: 'All payers', then each payer with a denial in the current figure and its count, most first\n('Cardinal 3', 'Summit 2', 'Beacon 1', ...)"
click cp "Click a payer chip"
process pp "Only that payer's rows; the chip is outlined; address ?payer=cardinal\nClick it again, or 'All payers', to clear it"
process pr "?reason= matches by inclusion: the reason and the denial's type or its words contain each other\nExample: 'Late notice' fits D-3290; 'Continued-stay evidence incomplete' fits D-3318"
screen rc "Chip 'Reason: Late notice' with an X ('Clear the reason')"
click cr "Click the X"
process pq "?reason= leaves the address"
decision d1 "Any rows left?"
screen e0 "'No denials match these filters'\nButton 'Clear filters' (payer, reason and figure)"
screen tb "The table shows only the matches, in the chosen order"
process p8 "An unknown payer id (?payer=zzz) has no chip and matches nothing: the empty state offers 'Clear filters'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials list"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened"
goto g3 "Continues in: Analytics › Denial reasons"

s1 --> fg --> cf --> pf --> d1
s1 --> pc --> cp --> pp --> d1
s1 -.-> pr --> rc --> cr --> pq --> d1
pr --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| tb --> g2
d1 -->|No| e0 --> g1
pp -.-> p8
s1 -.-> g3
